  "limits": [
    "Two fresh paired seeds94/95 and a reused holdout/evaluation split; sample SD is not a confidence interval.",
    "Each offset-enabled model adds81,920 parameters; this tests the feature at modest extra capacity, not an exactly parameter-matched change.",
    "All families share base initialization; within each s, existing adapter tensors and initial functions match. Offsets initialize at zero without consuming RNG.",
    "Both U and V offsets change together; this does not isolate which offset matters or establish a tuned learning rate.",
    "Adapter gain1/sqrt(8), adapter LR multiplier1 and base LR remain fixed; new update directions can change effective optimization.",
    "Fresh30k schedules are separate from the previous60k cohort; previous endpoint quality is context, not a rate-only or bias-only paired control.",
    "Generated factors remain per sample, broadcast across tokens; this does not measure per-token memory.",
    "Final CFG1/2 share one EMA state/noise;5k-image held-out FID and classifier agreement are pilot proxies.",
    "Concurrent compiled telemetry is not an isolated speed benchmark; no model weights or periodic checkpoints are saved."
